   500	```text
   501	registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index
   502	```
   503	
   504	Any other value, including any `git+`, `sparse+`, `path+` or alternate
   505	`registry+` form, is `build_rust_dependency_source_forbidden`.
   506	
   507	Every direct child of `V` MUST be a directory containing both `Cargo.toml` and
